## Context
Reported from sen-causal-reading, 2026-11-09 (housekeeping PR #154 there).
`skills/molt/SKILL.md` step 6 says, for an ungated base, "enable auto-merge so
it lands after CI". That repo has no CI and `allow_auto_merge: false`, so
`gh pr merge --auto` fails ("Auto merge is not allowed for this repository")
on every sweep before the direct merge succeeds. `skills/merge/SKILL.md`
step 6 already allows a direct merge "where the repo has auto-merge off and
every check is done"; molt's shortcut does not defer to it.

Author decision (2026-11-09): leave auto-merge off on repos without CI; fix
the skill, not the repo settings. No installer step should toggle it.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] molt step 6 lands an ungated request by `skills/merge/SKILL.md` step 6
      (direct merge when the repo has no checks or auto-merge is off) rather
      than restating "enable auto-merge"
- [ ] No other skill arms auto-merge on a repo where it is disabled
